@startuml
title SplitSmart Use Cases (Complete Product; Swing MVP subset)
left to right direction

actor "Individual user" as User
actor "Group organizer" as Organizer
actor "Expense approver" as Approver
actor "Notification provider\n(optional future)" as Notifier

rectangle "SplitSmart" {
  usecase "Manage account\nand sign in" as UCAccount
  usecase "Manage groups\nand membership" as UCGroups
  usecase "Submit expense\nand receipt" as UCSubmit
  usecase "Review expense" as UCReview
  usecase "View balances\nand record payment" as UCBalance
  usecase "View summaries\nand reports" as UCReport
  usecase "Receive expense\nnotice" as UCNotice
  usecase "Deliver optional email\nor push notice" as UCExternalNotice
}

User -- UCAccount
User -- UCGroups
User -- UCSubmit
User -- UCBalance
User -- UCReport
User -- UCNotice
Organizer -- UCGroups
Approver -- UCReview
Notifier -- UCExternalNotice

note bottom of User
  Proposed future product: web, Android, and iOS clients.
  Java Swing MVP is a separate implementation slice and does not
  satisfy the required web or mobile platforms.
end note
@enduml
